#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn about activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service."
msgstr ""
"Ketahui tentang peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti untuk perkhidmatan IBM Quantum"
" System."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service"
msgstr "Peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti untuk perkhidmatan IBM Quantum System"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service {#activity-"
"tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr ""
"Peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti untuk perkhidmatan IBM Quantum System "
"{#activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as the IBM&reg; Quantum System service, "
"generate activity tracking events.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perkhidmatan IBM Cloud&reg;, seperti perkhidmatan IBM&reg; Quantum System, "
"menjana peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activity tracking events report on activities that change the state of a "
"service in IBM Cloud. You can use the events to investigate abnormal "
"activity and critical actions and to comply with regulatory audit "
"requirements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti melaporkan aktiviti yang mengubah keadaan "
"perkhidmatan dalam IBM Cloud. Kamu boleh menggunakan peristiwa ini untuk "
"menyiasat aktiviti luar biasa dan tindakan kritikal serta mematuhi keperluan"
" audit kawal selia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, a platform service, to"
" route auditing events in your account to destinations of your choice by "
"configuring targets and routes that define where activity tracking events "
"are sent. For more information, see [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events"
" Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu boleh menggunakan IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, "
"perkhidmatan platform, untuk menghalakan peristiwa pengauditan dalam akaun "
"kamu ke destinasi pilihan kamu dengan mengkonfigurasi sasaran dan laluan "
"yang menentukan ke mana peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti dihantar. Untuk "
"maklumat lanjut, lihat [Mengenai IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events "
"Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Logs to visualize and alert on events that are "
"generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event "
"Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu boleh menggunakan IBM Cloud Logs untuk memvisualisasi dan memberi "
"amaran tentang peristiwa yang dijana dalam akaun kamu dan dihalakan oleh IBM"
" Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing ke instans IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Viewing activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service "
"{#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr ""
"Melihat peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti untuk perkhidmatan IBM Quantum System "
"{#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launching IBM Cloud Logs from the Observability page {#launching-ibm-cloud-"
"logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr ""
"Melancarkan IBM Cloud Logs dari halaman Observability {#launching-ibm-cloud-"
"logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the "
"UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-"
"launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk maklumat tentang melancarkan UI IBM Cloud Logs, lihat [Melancarkan "
"UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-"
"launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) dalam dokumentasi IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

